# Variáveis
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Login

POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "desafio"
}

###

## Calcular plano recomendado
POST {{baseUrl}}/calcular-plano
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phones": 4,
    "computers": 2,
    "smartTvs": 2,
    "tvBox": 0,
    "others": 3,
    "gamer": true
}

###

## Criar uma nova venda
POST {{baseUrl}}/criar-venda
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fabiano",
  "email": "emerson.nascimento@example.com",
  "telephone": "77981111111",
  "planId": "639b0494-9c22-4c71-8b39-d10cbbee6ab8",
  "weightTotal": 5.5,
  "devices": {
    "phones": 2,
    "computers": 3,
    "smartTvs": 1,
    "tvBox": 4,
    "others": 2,
    "gamer": true
  }
}

